{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@1786","endTime":315837.39,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 08\nParachute.\n\nA childcare discovery website with distinct paths for finding a nanny and exploring employment.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nChildcare & discovery\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nMake room for finding the right support.\n\nParachute’s interface introduces a nanny-focused service through a friendly illustrated website. The visible navigation separates finding a nanny from finding employment, establishing two audiences within one brand experience. Project-specific web screens extend the original laptop and tablet presentation.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Parachute's original project material.\n\n01\nFind a nanny\n\nA dedicated navigation path addresses people seeking childcare support.\n\n02\nFind employment\n\nA second path addresses prospective caregivers.\n\n03\nService introduction\n\nIllustrated sections introduce the product’s central proposition.\n\n04\nAbout information\n\nSupporting navigation provides a place for organizational context.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nChildcare & discovery\n\nSky blue, light backgrounds, and playful parachute illustrations set an approachable tone. A short navigation bar and spacious introductory panels keep the first steps visible, while supporting content explains the service below the hero.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Parachute.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n05\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nParachute's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nParachute / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nGlocal Expert\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nEDUCATION INTERFACE\nGlocal Expert\nWORKPLACE OPERATIONS\nMercury Mailroom\nMATRIMONY & DISCOVERY\nUmeed\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
